{"id":"nce1-067","book":"nce1","numbers":[67,68],"label":"Lesson 67–68","titleEn":"The Weekend","titleCn":"周末","audio":"media/lessons/nce1/067.mp3","lines":[{"t":3.32,"en":"The weekend","cn":"周末"},{"t":5.44,"en":"Listen to the tape then answer this question.","cn":"先听录音，然后回答这个问题："},{"t":10.87,"en":"What are the Johnsons going to do at the weekend?","cn":"约翰逊一家周末打算做什么？"},{"t":17.79,"en":"Hello. Were you at the butcher's?","cn":"你好。你去过肉店吗？"},{"t":21.9,"en":"Yes, I was.","cn":"你好，你去肉店了吗？"},{"t":23.89,"en":"Were you at the butcher's, too?","cn":"去了。"},{"t":27.41,"en":"No, I wasn't.","cn":"你也去肉店了吗？"},{"t":30.53,"en":"I was at the greengrocer's.","cn":"没有，我去的是蔬菜店。"},{"t":34.29,"en":"How's Jimmy today?","cn":"吉米今天怎么样？"},{"t":37.18,"en":"He's very well, thank you.","cn":"他很好，谢谢。"},{"t":41.17,"en":"Was he absent from school last week?","cn":"他上周缺课了吗？"},{"t":45.77,"en":"Yes, he was.","cn":"是的，他确实是那样的人。"},{"t":48.28,"en":"He was absent on Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday and Thursday.","cn":"他周一、周二、周三和周四都缺席了。"},{"t":55.93,"en":"How are you all keeping?","cn":"大家最近怎么样？过得还好吗？"},{"t":59.58,"en":"Very well, thank you.","cn":"好的，谢谢您。"},{"t":62.4,"en":"We're going to spend three days in the country!","cn":"我们将在这个国家待上三天！"},{"t":67.49,"en":"We're going to stay at my mother's for the weekend.","cn":"我们这个周末将住在妈妈家。"},{"t":73.43,"en":"Friday, Saturday and Sunday in the country!","cn":"周五、周六和周日，我都在乡下！"},{"t":78.99,"en":"Aren't you lucky!","cn":"你真幸运啊！"}],"words":[{"word":"greengrocer","phonetic":["'gri:nˌgrəusə"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"蔬菜水果零售商","us":"media/words/nce1/w0521_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0521_e.mp3"},{"word":"absent","phonetic":["'æbsənt","əb'sent"],"pos":"a.","meaning":"缺席的","us":"media/words/nce1/w0522_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0522_e.mp3"},{"word":"Monday","phonetic":["'mʌndi"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"星期一","us":"media/words/nce1/w0523_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0523_e.mp3"},{"word":"Tuesday","phonetic":["'tju:zdi:"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"星期二","us":"media/words/nce1/w0524_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0524_e.mp3"},{"word":"Wednesday","phonetic":["'wenzdi"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"星期三","us":"media/words/nce1/w0525_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0525_e.mp3"},{"word":"Thursday","phonetic":["'θə:zdi"],"pos":"","meaning":"星期四","us":"media/words/nce1/w0526_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0526_e.mp3"},{"word":"keep","phonetic":["ki:p"],"pos":"v.","meaning":"(身体健康)处于(状况)","us":"media/words/nce1/w0527_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0527_e.mp3"},{"word":"spend","phonetic":["spend"],"pos":"v.","meaning":"度过","us":"media/words/nce1/w0528_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0528_e.mp3"},{"word":"weekend","phonetic":["'wi:kend","ˌwi:k'end"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"周末","us":"media/words/nce1/w0529_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0529_e.mp3"},{"word":"Friday","phonetic":["'fraidi"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"星期五","us":"media/words/nce1/w0530_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0530_e.mp3"},{"word":"Saturday","phonetic":["'sætədi"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"星期六","us":"media/words/nce1/w0531_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0531_e.mp3"},{"word":"Sunday","phonetic":["'sʌndi"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"星期日","us":"media/words/nce1/w0532_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0532_e.mp3"},{"word":"country","phonetic":["'kʌntri"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"乡村","us":"media/words/nce1/w0379_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0379_e.mp3"},{"word":"lucky","phonetic":["'lʌki"],"pos":"a.","meaning":"幸运的","us":"media/words/nce1/w0533_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0533_e.mp3"},{"word":"church","phonetic":["tʃə:tʃ"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"教堂","us":"media/words/nce1/w0534_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0534_e.mp3"},{"word":"dairy","phonetic":["'deəri"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"乳品店","us":"media/words/nce1/w0535_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0535_e.mp3"},{"word":"baker","phonetic":["'beikə"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"面包师傅","us":"media/words/nce1/w0536_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0536_e.mp3"},{"word":"grocer","phonetic":["'grəusə"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"食品杂货商","us":"media/words/nce1/w0537_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce